{
  "title": "Exotic Snappy Moroccan Trout Amlou",
  "description": "A yeast-infused Moroccan dish featuring trout, score-fat, and traditional Amlou ingredients, perfect for a midnight craving. This kosher-friendly recipe combines the flavors of Morocco with the richness of score-fat.",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
